    "summary": "While the only units of yours in [Engagement Range](vsdata:core-rule/engagement-range) of an enemy unit are **FORTIFICATIONS**:\n\n- ranged attacks can still target that enemy unit, but each gets -1 to [Hit](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls) unless the attacking weapon is a [Pistol](vsdata:weapon-ability/pistol)\n- models in that enemy unit need not take [Desperate Escape tests](vsdata:core-rule/desperate-escape) for making a [fall-back move](vsdata:core-rule/fall-back) while [battle-shocked](vsdata:core-rule/battle-shock), unless they would pass over enemy models in doing so",
